---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Capabilities — Custom Web, Cloud, CRM, AI"
  description="What we typically build, beyond the AI Inbox productized service: custom web apps, Azure cloud setup, CRM automation, AI agents, and integration work."
>
  <section class="bg-navy-950 text-white py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">Custom Work — What We Typically Build</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-300">Our productized service is <a href="/services/ai-inbox/" class="text-blue-300 hover:underline">AI Inbox</a> for high-touch service businesses. Everything else is custom scope. Here's the kind of work we take on and what it usually looks like.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">

        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-8 border border-slate-200">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🤖</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy-950 mb-3">AI &amp; Agents</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">AI assistants that actually do work — not chatbot demos. Email response automation, document extraction, lead routing, content generation pipelines, customer support triage.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500"><strong>Typical scope:</strong> 2-6 weeks. Fixed-price quote after the discovery call.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-8 border border-slate-200">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">☁️</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy-950 mb-3">Cloud &amp; DevOps</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">Azure infrastructure done right the first time. Web apps on App Service or Static Web Apps. Function Apps. Key Vault for secrets. Managed Identity. GitHub Actions OIDC deploys with no stored credentials. ACS for email + SMS.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500"><strong>Typical scope:</strong> 1-3 weeks. Fixed-price quote after the discovery call.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-8 border border-slate-200">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">📊</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy-950 mb-3">CRM &amp; Operations</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">Custom CRM for businesses Salesforce/HubSpot don't quite fit. Booking pipelines, payment tracking with Stripe, customer history, attribution from first-touch through retention. Mobile-first for owners on the road.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500"><strong>Typical scope:</strong> 4-12 weeks. Fixed-price quote after the discovery call.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-8 border border-slate-200">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🌐</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy-950 mb-3">Web Builds</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">Fast, SEO-strong, conversion-focused websites. Astro + Tailwind on Azure Static Web Apps. Forms wired to email + CRM + Stripe. Real Lighthouse scores, real Core Web Vitals, real organic search results.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500"><strong>Typical scope:</strong> 2-5 weeks. Fixed-price quote after the discovery call.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy-950 mb-6">How a custom engagement works</h2>
      <ol class="space-y-4 text-slate-700 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-500 text-white text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">1</span> <span><strong>Free 30-minute discovery call.</strong> Tell us the problem; we tell you whether we can help and roughly what it would cost.</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-500 text-white text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">2</span> <span><strong>Written scope + fixed quote</strong> within 3 business days. You see the architecture, the deliverables, and the price before you commit a dollar.</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-500 text-white text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">3</span> <span><strong>Build phase.</strong> Half up front, half on delivery. Weekly demo, GitHub access if you want it, no surprise change orders.</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-500 text-white text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">4</span> <span><strong>Handoff or retainer.</strong> Most clients keep an ongoing-care retainer (scoped on the call). You can also walk away with the code and run it yourself.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="mt-10">
        <a href="/contact/?service=custom" class="inline-flex items-center px-8 py-4 bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors text-lg min-h-[44px]">
          Book a Discovery Call →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
